%% Text interview sequence
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Candidate
  participant F as React Frontend
  participant G as FastAPI Gateway
  participant O as Interview Orchestrator
  participant R as Repository
  U->>F: Start text interview
  F->>G: Authenticated start request
  G->>O: Load profile and prepare session
  O->>R: Persist plan session and first turn
  R-->>O: Stored session
  O-->>F: First question
  U->>F: Submit answer
  F->>G: Answer request
  G->>O: Evaluate and choose next action
  O->>R: Persist evaluation and state
  O-->>F: Updated session or completion
